After `qs` 6.14.1, Express URL-encoded form parsing changed behavior for arrays. Is there a recommended way to keep the default behavior of getting arrays instead of objects when posting arrays? Example:

```js
app.use(express.urlencoded({ limit: '50mb', extended: false }));

<form method="post">
<select multiple name="test">
<option value="">placeholder</option>
<option value="1">a</option>
<option value="2">b</option>
</select>
